# Map colours

Use these colours for any map you draw or style for Home Assistant: the base map, zones, the reported locations of people and devices, and areas. Map colours stay the same in light and dark mode and do not change with the household's theme colour, so a map reads the same on every dashboard.

<%= colour_copy_status %>

